      "text": "AMERICAN MATHEMATICAL SOCIETY S 0894-0347(00)00337-4 — 22 sections: Front matter; Plancherel measures; Introduction\n\n**AMERICAN MATHEMATICAL SOCIETY S 0894-0347(00)00337-4**\n\n*Article electronically published on April 13, 2000*\n\n35 pp, 22 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1.1 Plancherel measures; 1 Introduction; 1.2 Poissonization and correlation functions; 1.3 Asymptotics in the bulk of the spectrum; 1.4 Behavior near the edge of the spectrum and; 1.5 Poissonization and depoissonization; 1.6 Organization of the paper; 2 Correlation functions of the measures M; 2.3 Various formulas for the kernel J; 2.4 Commuting difference operator; 3 Correlation functions in the bulk of the spe; 4 Edge of the spectrum: Convergence to the Air; 4.1 Results and strategy of proof; 4.3 Depoissonization and proof of Theorem ??; Appendix A. General properties of determinanta; A.1. Fredholm determinants and determinantal p; A.2. Correlation functions of determinantal pr",
